sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant BATCH as SVC-001 Batch Scheduler
    participant CAP001 as CAP-001 API (SVC-001)
    participant EventBus as Event Bus (SVC-102)
    participant CAP004 as CAP-004 (SVC-012)
    participant EXTBUREAU as EXT: Credit Bureau
    participant SVC053 as SVC-053 (Notifications)
    participant PER001 as PER-001 (Personal Customer)

    Note over BATCH,CAP001: PH-083: Automated Review Trigger
    BATCH->>CAP001: Identify account with overdraft expiring within 30 days
    CAP001->>CAP001: Create OverdraftReview (ENT-054) status=initiated
    CAP001--)EventBus: publish OverdraftReviewTriggered EVT-114

    Note over CAP004,EXTBUREAU: PH-084: Credit Bureau Refresh
    EventBus--)CAP004: EVT-114 consumed
    CAP004->>EXTBUREAU: Credit bureau refresh
    EXTBUREAU-->>CAP004: Bureau score=480, adverse data present
    CAP004--)EventBus: publish OverdraftAssessmentCompleted EVT-115 (grade=E)

    Note over CAP001: PH-085: Persistent Debt Screening (36-month trigger)
    EventBus--)CAP001: EVT-115 consumed
    CAP001->>CAP001: Persistent debt: interest > principal for 36 cumulative months
    CAP001--)EventBus: publish PersistentDebtScreeningCompleted EVT-116 (36_month_trigger)

    Note over CAP001: PH-086: Decision — Facility Suspension
    CAP001->>CAP001: Decision: suspend. Account.overdraft_facility_status=suspended
    CAP001--)EventBus: publish OverdraftReviewDecided EVT-117 (decision=suspend)

    Note over SVC053,PER001: PH-087: Suspension Notice + Debt Advice
    CAP001--)SVC053: Dispatch suspension notice + debt advice signposting
    SVC053--)PER001: Letter + push: overdraft suspended. StepChange 0800 138 1111
    CAP001--)EventBus: publish OverdraftCustomerNotified EVT-118
